Cell["\<\
s is the spin-weight of the perturbing field
\[Lambda] is the spin-weighted spheroidal eigenvalue
\[Omega] is the mode frequency\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.986189163159597*^9, 
  3.9861892082839613`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"91798620-2e21-4dd2-98ed-\
805aa8d297ea"],

Cell["\<\
In particular, the integrator solve an equivalent set of equations that can \
be derived using the following ansatzs ( see Eq. (13) of arXiv 1102.2451. \
Bear in the mind, there is a typo in that paper)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.98602796579278*^9, 3.9860280323818483`*^9}, {
